                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is just another awful low-budget indie horror game with dull gameplay. This game is also WAY too dark and you can only see through a tiny little circle of light from the flashlight. There is no brightness/gamma option. You also cannot play in 4k resolution and the graphics (from what you can see anyway) look pretty rough in lower resolutions. You also cannot disable the terrible headbob in this game and there is no crouch animation. You abruptly go from standing to crouching with no transition at all. Overall, it's just another boring indie title that i cannot recommend.",
